Welcome! 👋

This repository documents my learning journey through the Microsoft DevOps Engineer Expert learning plan on Microsoft Learn. 
My goal is to understand the core concepts and practices of DevOps, including development, collaboration, automation, continuous integration, and continuous delivery,  that can help other learners preparing for the Microsoft DevOps Engineer Expert certification.

Microsoft Learn Learning Plan:
https://learn.microsoft.com/plans/o1w7fgt670k82d?sharingId=EDAE4CDD4795E21E&wt.mc_id=studentamb_573147

This Learning Plan contains:
Key DevOps concepts and important takeaways
Module-wise summaries
Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery (CI/CD)
Automation, infrastructure, and application deployment
Useful Microsoft documentation and learning resources for DevOps preparation

The modules are intended to provide a helpful reference for students and beginners exploring DevOps practices and Microsoft Azure DevOps solutions.

🎯 Learning Objectives
Through this learning plan, I aim to:
* Understand the fundamentals of DevOps practices and culture
* Learn about source control and collaborative development
* Explore Continuous Integration and Continuous Delivery (CI/CD)
* Understand application and infrastructure automation
* Learn about monitoring, testing, and deployment strategies
* Explore Azure DevOps and related Microsoft services
* Build a strong foundation for the DevOps Engineer Expert certification

Upon completion of this learning plan, learners will be ready to prepare for the Microsoft DevOps Engineer Expert certification.

Feel free to explore the modules, learn along with me, and share your suggestions or feedback!
